  - m_Id: 94804563591168
    m_Localized: CAMERA ACCESS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94804605534208
    m_Localized: Hauntscope needs the camera to show ghosts in your room. Without
      it, you'll hunt in the Virtual Room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94804605534209
    m_Localized: Camera access is turned off. Open the app settings and allow Camera
      in Permissions. Without it, you'll hunt in the Virtual Room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94804605534210
    m_Localized: ALLOW CAMERA
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94804605534211
    m_Localized: OPEN SETTINGS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94804605534212
    m_Localized: PLAY IN VIRTUAL ROOM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94804605534213
    m_Localized: AR UNAVAILABLE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94804605534214
    m_Localized: Your device doesn't support AR. You'll hunt in the Virtual Room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94804605534215
    m_Localized: OK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 111728735420416
    m_Localized: Hauntscope is a game for entertainment purposes only. It does not
      detect real paranormal activity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 111728768974848
    m_Localized: Hauntscope
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 123992666406912
    m_Localized: TRAINING {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 123992691572736
    m_Localized: Drag on the left side to walk. Swipe on the right side to look around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 123992691572737
    m_Localized: 'A ghost is here, but invisible. Follow the EMF meter: the closer
      it is, the faster it beeps.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 123992691572738
    m_Localized: Tap LENS and turn slowly. The lens reveals the ghost, but it drains
      the battery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 123992691572739
    m_Localized: It froze! Hold the BEAM and keep it inside the ring.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
